2. "<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lost_in_France" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Lost in France</a>" 3:54<br>
3. "<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faster_Than_the_Speed_of_Night_(song)" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">Faster Than the Speed of Night</a>" 6:42<br>
